-- A correction of fx_stats: lines that work already, shown as unbuilt until now. Nothing changes in play except
-- the gem level lines named at the end, which are new in this change.
--
-- 365 display stats of "Socketed Gems are Supported by Level # ..." lines: the support comes from the mod's own
-- granted effect (GemSupports.ItemCandidates), not from the stat, so every such line works wherever its mod is.
